      "text": {
        "title": "Gestern war er krank",
        "de": "Gestern war der Patient krank. Er hatte Fieber. Ich war auf der Station. Wir hatten viel Arbeit. Warst du im Zimmer? Du hattest die Akte. Die Ärzte waren da. Sie hatten keine Zeit.",
        "en": "Yesterday the patient was ill. He had a fever. I was on the ward. We had a lot of work. Were you in the room? You had the chart. The doctors were there. They had no time."
      }
